rom 0.6 deaths per 100,000 live births during 1999–2008 to 2.5 during 2009–2010.\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Ectopic pregnancy mortality ratios were calculated as numbers of deaths per 100,000 live births using natality files for the denominator.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Poisson distribution was used to calculate 95% confidence intervals.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Significance was assessed using the mid-p exact test (p<0.05).\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Mortality ratio calculated using deaths and births from March 2004 through December 2008.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"P-value <0.01 calculated by mid-p exact test.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}